From: yaegerbomb42 <yaeger.james42@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 20:59:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(l5): Playwright MCP on the visible Chromium for the
 agent browser

---
 apps/swarmagents/lib/harness/runner.test.ts | 149 +++++++++++++++++++-
 apps/swarmagents/lib/harness/runner.ts      |  17 ++-
 apps/swarmagents/vm-image/Dockerfile        |  19 +++
 apps/swarmagents/vm-image/claude-mcp.json   |  12 ++
